---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { shopWithUtm } from '../lib/etsy';
import familyStory from '../assets/family-story.jpg';

const etsyShopUrl = shopWithUtm('home');
const siteBase = Astro.site!.origin;

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: `${siteBase}/` },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Our Story', item: `${siteBase}/story` },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story | Curated Threads Outdoors"
  description="Meet the family behind Curated Threads Outdoors, a father-daughter shop built around hunting, fishing, and patriotic pride. Every design starts at our kitchen table and gets tested in the same woods and water we've loved for years."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />

  <section class="border-b border-gold/30 bg-parchment px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-gold">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl text-sepia sm:text-5xl">Family Owned & Operated</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-10">
    <Image
      src={familyStory}
      alt="Daniel and his family together in Alaska"
      widths={[640, 1024, 1536]}
      sizes="(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"
      quality={85}
      loading="eager"
      class="w-full rounded-sm shadow-lg"
    />
  </div>

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Daniel. Curated Threads Outdoors is a small shop I run with my daughter, and
      it started the way a lot of the best things do: with the two of us at the kitchen
      table, laughing about inside jokes from a recent hunting trip and doodling them onto
      napkins. Some of those doodles ended up on shirts. Some ended up on mugs. And enough
      of them made people smile that we decided to open the doors and share them with folks
      like you.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6">
      These days the catalog is a mix of quiet scenes from the field, the water, and the
      trail, plus a few jokes only a hunter or an angler will really catch. Every piece has
      to pass one simple test before it earns a spot in the shop: would we happily wrap it
      up and give it to someone we love? If the answer is anything short of yes, it never
      makes it in.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6">
      When you order, it is made just for you, ships free, and comes through our Etsy shop
      with their buyer protection on every order. Thank you for spending a few minutes here.
      We hope something in the collection ends up in the hands of a hunter, angler, or
      outdoor lover who matters to you.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
      <a
        href={etsyShopUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="rounded-sm bg-forest px-6 py-3 font-bold text-cream transition hover:bg-forest-dark"
      >
        Shop on Etsy
      </a>
      <a
        href="/faq"
        class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-forest hover:text-blaze"
      >
        Shipping and Returns &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
